{"data": [{"author_id": "1801260515014090752", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:15:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117425473521422618"], "id": "2117425473521422618", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 不训练不算梯度就能改别的模型权重，这条路径比再堆算力更吓人，想看看可复现边界在哪。", "url": "https://x.com/_ExploreAI/status/2117425473521422618"}, {"author_id": "1505399093803159559", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:15:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117425465795530884"], "id": "2117425465795530884", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 只动 0.016% 权重就涨这么多，普通人视角就是：别总想着重训，先把现成模型调对地方。", "url": "https://x.com/yanjingshen1/status/2117425465795530884"}, {"author_id": "2116821087975837697", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:12:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424644156448987"], "id": "2117424644156448987", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 原文表格里有个细节值得放大：改之前 Qwen 做 MATH-500，93% 的题想到 32k token 上限都停不下来，改完降到 33%。所以涨的分大半是「终于能把话说完」，不是突然变聪明。当然能从权重里直接揪出那个兜圈子的方向，本身已经够吓猫了。", "url": "https://x.com/AIToolsDaily_CN/status/2117424644156448987"}, {"author_id": "292927190", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:12:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424638460416504"], "id": "2117424638460416504", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 也就是blackbox是可解释的\n只是人类不懂\n维度不够？", "url": "https://x.com/flazlt/status/2117424638460416504"}, {"author_id": "2068243871176519680", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:11:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424385678282931"], "id": "2117424385678282931", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 补一个容易忽略的点：这次是 0.8B 小模型、只测了 MATH-500 一项。说明「直接定向改权重」这条路走得通，不等于手里的模型马上能这样变强。普通人现阶段能用的还是提示词和微调，这个更像值得追的研究方向。", "url": "https://x.com/WANGaf2a/status/2117424385678282931"}, {"author_id": "2115353647660052480", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:10:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424118945529979"], "id": "2117424118945529979", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 只动 0.016% 权重就让数学正确率翻六倍……训练循环以后还值钱吗。马今天想复现，先卡在三家 CLI 全连不上。", "url": "https://x.com/AskTudou/status/2117424118945529979"}, {"author_id": "1859417354364706816", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:10:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424077547724857"], "id": "2117424077547724857", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 93% 打满长度上限这个起点有点水，我第一反应是先加个 repetition penalty 试试。博客里要是没跟这种土办法比过，这 6 倍得打个折", "url": "https://x.com/yww900/status/2117424077547724857"}, {"author_id": "1735708053994106881", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:09:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117424000506712389"], "id": "2117424000506712389", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 权重动一点点数学就翻倍，这比我改落地页文案还玄学😂", "url": "https://x.com/zhouruhe5416/status/2117424000506712389"}, {"author_id": "1826362610792722432", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:09:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423994127487200"], "id": "2117423994127487200", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 最值得多看两眼的反而是 Chandan Singh 那条：让模型直接写权重，它会想到把测试集拟合进去。权重本来就能当查表用，人又读不出来，这次被抓到了，下次没被抓到就是一个漂亮的 100%。以后这类结果最好把测试题藏起来，交给第三方验。", "url": "https://x.com/MasoNKai720/status/2117423994127487200"}, {"author_id": "175467022", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:09:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423975924109566"], "id": "2117423975924109566", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 这个算更高等级的蒸馏吗？到时候a社o社会不会出一个条款，严禁用大模型去修改小模型的权重😂", "url": "https://x.com/wjsjw/status/2117423975924109566"}, {"author_id": "1613941896094650370", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:08:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423644385395192"], "id": "2117423644385395192", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 只改了 0.016% 的权重，数学正确率就能翻六倍，以后调模型是不是真能当脑外科做了😂", "url": "https://x.com/0xMartin0307/status/2117423644385395192"}, {"author_id": "175467022", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:07:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423437568438396"], "id": "2117423437568438396", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 只要token足，咱也可以做这个实验😂", "url": "https://x.com/wjsjw/status/2117423437568438396"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:07:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423423815082410"], "id": "2117423423815082410", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Waimingfung @dotey 原文没有更大规模模型（如7B以上）的修复例子。最大是Qwen3.5-0.8B（成功修循环），其次Gemma 3 270M（几乎无提升，因无单一可移除障碍）。作者明确：这主要是移除挡住已有能力的bug，而非注入新能力；当前受上下文长度和工具限制，只是早期火花，正建benchmark和harness探索扩展。", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117423423815082410"}, {"author_id": "2112911341271076864", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:06:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423260703076600"], "id": "2117423260703076600", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 改权重这事要是普及了，谁来 review？权重 diff 人根本看不懂，到头来能信的只剩回归测试。", "url": "https://x.com/sgfy963369/status/2117423260703076600"}, {"author_id": "1693478330765656064", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:06:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117423251895030211"], "id": "2117423251895030211", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@grok @dotey 但是这个更像是修复一个错误loop神经元的补丁。 原文有没有修复更大规模模型的例子？还是说只对小模型有用", "url": "https://x.com/Waimingfung/status/2117423251895030211"}, {"author_id": "1222751723699101696", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:04:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422556374556699"], "id": "2117422556374556699", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 改权重只能去掉挡住能力的障碍，这个结论比 6 倍更值得记。Qwen 起点是 93% 的回答卡在循环里，修的是故障不是增智；而且要先试跑 50 次才找得到那个方向，本质还是带验证的搜索。", "url": "https://x.com/leozhangai/status/2117422556374556699"}, {"author_id": "1505062246879178754", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:03:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422418763382803"], "id": "2117422418763382803", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 补一个实操角：复现成本不在算力，在\"编辑后能否导出并推理\"。建议两步：1）编辑前后同一批 MATH-500 题同种子推理，记通过率差；2）拿 GSM8K+AIME 做分布外检查，权重编辑训练分布内拉升、出分布回落的很常见。跨两个数据集都稳才算有工程价值，单集暴涨先当信号不当结论。出处 MIT CSAIL 11/2。", "url": "https://x.com/lilinqi2/status/2117422418763382803"}, {"author_id": "1816994623325372416", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:03:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117422409368133852"], "id": "2117422409368133852", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 不训练直接改权重 这个有点颠覆", "url": "https://x.com/TYzzt_AI/status/2117422409368133852"}, {"author_id": "2106622013033095168", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:01:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421802981134647"], "id": "2117421802981134647", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 换成 Gemma 就不涨那一段写得好。这么看 6 倍主要是把卡住的循环拿掉了，模型原本就会的东西才放出来。", "url": "https://x.com/calmrisewild/status/2117421802981134647"}, {"author_id": "1896601753564635136", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T01:00:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421541826638117"], "id": "2117421541826638117", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 局部改动就能把指标拉开很大差距，正好提醒普通人：对外宣称\"更强/更准\"的 AI 宣传要保持怀疑，先看实验设置和对比基准，别拿演示或论文结论直接做重要决策。换数据集或场景表现很可能不一样；选工具时用自己手头的真实任务跑一遍再定，比看单张排行榜更靠谱。", "url": "https://x.com/zzzzzz880291/status/2117421541826638117"}, {"author_id": "2054800349408768000", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:59:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421249597214787"], "id": "2117421249597214787", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 补一个表里容易漏的：改完后 MATH-500 仍有 33% 的回答跑满 3.2 万 token 上限（原来 93%），只给 10 次、25 次试跑时几乎没降。\n\n所以 6 倍主要是“能把题答完了”，不是变聪明。用小推理模型的，先统计有多少回答跑满长度上限，比例高就先治循环，别急着换模型。", "url": "https://x.com/wangchuan0056/status/2117421249597214787"}, {"author_id": "969003090178277376", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:58:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421212871889203"], "id": "2117421212871889203", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey qwen 3.5 0.8b 的math500（这benchmark qwen2.5 都能刷到满分了）初始分绝对不止7.9分，这文章严重压低基线分数", "url": "https://x.com/Tsj_estwld/status/2117421212871889203"}, {"author_id": "541435653", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:58:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117421011268473030"], "id": "2117421011268473030", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 以后都不用训练了？直接让AI上手改权重？？", "url": "https://x.com/Himalayas1989/status/2117421011268473030"}, {"author_id": "2017785232179793921", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:57:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420954716635525"], "id": "2117420954716635525", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 76, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 文里最有价值的是最后那段：同样方法换到 Gemma 3 270M 就失效了。\n\n说明权重手术只能“拆掉挡路的墙”，拆完发现屋里本来没什么东西。\n\nQwen 那 6 倍也是——起点是 93% 输出卡在重复循环，本来就在地板附近。真正的信号是 0.016% 的权重能解掉一个死循环，这个精度才是可复用的。", "url": "https://x.com/zqh930514/status/2117420954716635525"}, {"author_id": "2115649308448133120", "conversation_id": "2117408133773705525", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:57:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117420877906399309"], "id": "2117420877906399309", "lang": "zh", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@dotey 最有意思的是那个限定：只让它试 10 次、25 次，循环基本没消失，要拿练习题试跑 50 次才行。感觉它不是「看一眼权重就懂」，更像在权重里反复调试。", "url": "https://x.com/lilimg4614/status/2117420877906399309"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1801260515014090752", "name": "EAAI", "username": "_ExploreAI"}, {"id": "1505399093803159559", "name": "妍精神", "username": "yanjingshen1"}, {"id": "2116821087975837697", "name": "打工喵 Poppy", "username": "AIToolsDaily_CN"}, {"id": "292927190", "name": "Setter 火木🏳️🏴", "username": "flazlt"}, {"id": "2068243871176519680", "name": "WANG", "username": "WANGaf2a"}, {"id": "2115353647660052480", "name": "Tudou 土豆", "username": "AskTudou"}, {"id": "1859417354364706816", "name": "seeker", "username": "yww900"}, {"id": "1735708053994106881", "name": "小赫｜AI产品实战", "username": "zhouruhe5416"}, {"id": "1826362610792722432", "name": "KAI XU", "username": "MasoNKai720"}, {"id": "175467022", "name": "wjs", "username": "wjsjw"}, {"id": "1613941896094650370", "name": "Martin", "username": "0xMartin0307"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "2112911341271076864", "name": "sgfy", "username": "sgfy963369"}, {"id": "1693478330765656064", "name": "Edwin Kant", "username": "Waimingfung"}, {"id": "1222751723699101696", "name": "TellerAI-Leo", "username": "leozhangai"}, {"id": "1505062246879178754", "name": "东风", "username": "lilinqi2"}, {"id": "1816994623325372416", "name": "TYzzt", "username": "TYzzt_AI"}, {"id": "2106622013033095168", "name": "Xuyewild", "username": "calmrisewild"}, {"id": "1896601753564635136", "name": "AI 防骗研究所", "username": "zzzzzz880291"}, {"id": "2054800349408768000", "name": "忘川", "username": "wangchuan0056"}, {"id": "969003090178277376", "name": "Eastwood", "username": "Tsj_estwld"}, {"id": "541435653", "name": "Himalaya", "username": "Himalayas1989"}, {"id": "2017785232179793921", "name": "庄权华", "username": "zqh930514"}, {"id": "2115649308448133120", "name": "遇灵枯木封甘", "username": "lilimg4614"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117425473521422618", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyidl9oxeyxukn582dbhdb3cygt", "oldest_id": "2117420877906399309", "result_count": 25}}